{"schemaVersion":1,"records":[["open-nalan-147648eb7aa74dcb7b91","詞",["初春的薄霧像染筆般，將柳樹染成鵝黃色。","微風吹拂，柳條隨風飄動，看起來既像是被整理過，又像是隨心擺盪。","春寒乍至，柳枝顯得消瘦，彷彿支撐不住。","清涼的氣息侵入了清晨的美夢，連蟬翼都覺得膩煩。","花兒漸漸開得豐滿，紅艷艷的。","卻不吝惜地讓枝葉繁茂盛放。","把碾碎的沉香粉鋪在地上，當作地毯。"],"fbb31069072264ba0faa3bae7a4109c60045bebcea4d3a6ef0762e9c9be76d79",{"quality":"machine-draft-unreviewed","status":"pending-review","sourceLabel":"Leafbound AI 今譯 · 初步可用","displayStatus":"待人工校訂","productionReady":false,"model":"Qwen3.5-9B-Local","modelRevision":"local-deployment-2026-08-29","promptVersion":"leafbound-classical-v2-targeted-retry1","warnings":["paragraph-count-mismatch"],"generatedAt":"2026-08-29T12:17:30.000Z","editorialTriage":"initially-usable","review":{"reviewer":"Leafbound owner","reviewedAt":"2026-08-29T14:00:00.000Z","note":"初步抽查通過；仍待逐篇精校。"}}]]}
